@startsalt
' Screen: Prompt Detail / Editor
' User Stories:
'   - As a developer, I can write and edit prompt templates with variable syntax
'   - As a developer, I can define required and optional variables with defaults
'   - As an admin, I can publish a prompt version to make it available library-wide
'   - As a developer, I can see which script nodes reference this prompt
'   - As a developer, I can view version history and restore prior versions

{
  <b>codefre.sh</b> | Dashboard | Scripts | <b>Prompts</b> | Agents | Schedules | Settings
  ==
  {
    [< Back to Library]  |  <b>Edit Prompt</b>  |  <color:orange><i>Draft — not published</i></color>  |  [Save Draft]  [Publish]
  }
  ==
  {
    ' Name / metadata row
    Name:  "Code Review Bot                           "
    Slug:  "code-review-bot                           "   <i>(auto-generated, editable)</i>
    Desc:  "Reviews code diffs and suggests improvements based on language and style guide."
    Tags:  "code-review, ai, engineering                "  [+ Add Tag]
  }
  ..
  {/ <b>Editor</b> | Variables | Tools | Test | History }
  ==
  {
    ' Two-column: editor left, variables sidebar right
    {
      ' Left: body editor
      <b>Prompt Body</b>  |  <i>Markdown + {{variable}} syntax supported</i>
      {+
        "You are a senior {{language}} engineer performing a code review.            "
        "                                                                             "
        "Reviewer persona: {{reviewer_persona}}                                      "
        "                                                                             "
        "Review the following diff and provide:                                      "
        "1. A summary of changes                                                     "
        "2. Potential issues or bugs                                                 "
        "3. Style and readability suggestions                                        "
        "4. A recommended action: Approve / Request Changes / Comment Only           "
        "                                                                             "
        "Diff:                                                                       "
        "{{diff_content}}                                                            "
        "                                                                             "
        "Respond in {{output_language}} using {{output_format}} format.              "
      }
      ..
      <i>3 variables detected: language, reviewer_persona, diff_content, output_language, output_format</i>
    } | {
      ' Right: variables sidebar
      <b>Variables</b>  [+ Add Variable]
      ==
      <b>language</b>
      Type: ^String^   Required: (X) Yes  () No
      Default: "                    "
      Description: "Programming language of the diff"
      --
      <b>reviewer_persona</b>
      Type: ^String^   Required: (X) Yes  () No
      Default: "                    "
      Description: "Style/tone of reviewer"
      --
      <b>diff_content</b>
      Type: ^Text^     Required: (X) Yes  () No
      Default: "                    "
      Description: "The raw diff to review"
      --
      <b>output_language</b>
      Type: ^String^   Required: () Yes  (X) No
      Default: "en                  "
      Description: "Response language (ISO 639-1)"
      --
      <b>output_format</b>
      Type: ^Enum^     Required: () Yes  (X) No
      Default: "markdown            "
      Values: markdown, json, plain
      ==
      <b>Referenced by</b>
      ..
      3 script nodes use this prompt:
      • review-pr-script  (v2, pinned)
      • nightly-audit     (latest)
      • ci-gate           (latest)
    }
  }
}
@endsalt
